## 9. Visualizations

The following plots were generated:

* Confusion Matrix
* ROC Curve
* Model Comparison Chart

These visualizations help compare the performance of both classifiers.

## 10. Model Selection

Based on the evaluation metrics, Logistic Regression achieved the best overall performance and was selected as the final model for deployment.

## 11. Conclusion

A complete spam message classification system was successfully developed using supervised machine learning techniques.

The project demonstrated:

* Text preprocessing
* Feature extraction using TF-IDF
* Model training and evaluation
* Cross-validation
* Algorithm comparison
* Performance visualization

The selected model can be further deployed for real-time spam detection applications.
